- IPv6

Application layer values:
- http
- https
- quic', example='IPv4', position='Query'),
  locationNameEn?: string(name='LocationNameEn', description='The name of the region in English. If you do not specify this parameter, data of all regions is queried by default.', example='beijing', position='Query'),
  ownerId?: long(name='OwnerId', position='Query'),
  startTime?: string(name='StartTime', description='The beginning of the time range to query.

