- **ManifestName**: the file name of the output master playlist. Default value: master. The .m3u8 extension is not allowed.', example='{"OutputDir":"output/editmanifest/","ManifestName":"master"}', position='Query'),
  removeTracks?: string(name='RemoveTracks', description='The configuration of tracks to be removed. The value is a JSON string. It contains the following fields:
- **AudioLanguages**: the list of audio language identifiers for which the entire audio tracks are to be removed.
